Wait, I need to reconsider this. Looking at the changes again, most are gradle-related build artifacts and temporary files. Let me create a more focused .gitignore:

```
# Gradle
.gradle/
!gradle/wrapper/

# Build artifacts
build/
dist/
target/

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp
*.lock

